{"ref":"BDB, צִיָּה","hw":"צִיָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צִיָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. dryness, drought</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:5\" href=\"/Hosea.2.5\">Ho 2:5</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:41\" href=\"/Psalms.105.41\">ψ 105:41</a>;—<em>drought</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:19\" href=\"/Job.24.19\">Jb 24:19</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹם</span>); elsewhere of land (often ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְבָּר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲרָבָה</span>, etc.): <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ צ׳</span> <em>land of drought, desert</em> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:5\" href=\"/Hosea.2.5\">Ho 2:5</a> (sim.), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.6\">Je 2:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.12\">50:12</a> (fig.), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:43\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.43\">51:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.18\">Is 41:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.2\">53:2</a> (in sim.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:35\" href=\"/Psalms.107.35\">ψ 107:35</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">צָמָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 19:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.19.13\">Ez 19:13</a> (fig.), + <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמָמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:20\" href=\"/Joel.2.20\">Jo 2:20</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">עָיֵף</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 63:2\" href=\"/Psalms.63.2\">ψ 63:2</a> (fig.); <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> = <em>desert</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.1\">Is 35:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:13\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.13\">Zp 2:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:3\" href=\"/Job.30.3\">Jb 30:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:17\" href=\"/Psalms.78.17\">ψ 78:17</a>; pl. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:41\" href=\"/Psalms.105.41\">105:41</a>.","next":"BDB, צָיוֹן","prev":"BDB, ציה"}